window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She will fight for what is hers.</p> <p>When Katerina’s brother exiled her from the kingdom in a murderous plot to take the throne, the last thing he ever imagined was that she’d come back. Much less...with an army of her own.</p> <p>As the two sides prepare for battle, the princess finds herself at a crossroads. New alliances are made as old friendships are thrown into question. The dark wizard is moving ever closer, and a heartbreaking betrayal leaves everything up for grabs.</p> <p>The supernatural community has rallied behind her, but will it be enough? Can she keep the peace long enough to take her rightful place on the throne? Will this new power make her stronger, or will she find herself at the mercy of forces beyond her control?</p> <p>The players are ready. The board is set. Now all that’s left to do is roll the dice...</p> <p>Be careful who you trust. Even the devil was once an angel.</p> <p>Queen's Alpha Series:</p> <p></p> <ul> <li><i>Eternal</i></li> <li><i>Everlasting</i></li> <li><i>Unceasing</i></li> <li><i>Evermore</i></li> <li><i>Forever</i></li> <li><i>Boundless</i></li> <li><i>Prophecy</i></li> <li><i>Protected</i></li> <li><i>Foretelling</i></li> <li><i>Revelation</i></li> <li><i>Betrayal</i></li> <li><i>Resolved</i></li> </ul> <p>The Omega Queen Series:</p> <p></p> <ul> <li><i>Discipline</i></li> <li><i>Bravery</i></li> <li><i>Courage</i></li> <li><i>Conquer</i></li> <li><i>Strength</i></li> <li><i>Validation</i></li> <li><i>Approval</i></li> <li><i>Blessing</i></li> <li><i>Balance</i></li> <li><i>Grievance</i></li> <li><i>Enchanted</i></li> <li><i>Gratified</i></li> </ul>"; 
